        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "How about your future? How do you see it?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "I don’t know. I guess I just need to decide if I want to stay here or move somewhere else. It feels like a big choice, so I’m just putting it off."
