        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Is it tough for you to make decisions?"
        },
        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": "Yeah, I guess so. I always worry I’ll make the wrong choice. I’m sorry, I’m just being a bit of a downer today."
